<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  materia-guard.liquid  —  Materia theme activation gate (single source of truth)

  ONE gate for the whole theme. A blurred activation modal shown only when the
  licence server (app.materiathemes.com) — keyed on this store's permanent
  .myshopify.com domain — explicitly reports the store as NOT licensed.

  Design rules that make a false gate impossible on a paying store:
    • The answer is server-side and keyed on shop.permanent_domain, so incognito,
      new devices, a custom domain and cleared storage all get the SAME result.
    • It FAILS OPEN on every ambiguous outcome (timeout, network error, non-JSON,
      unrecognised shop, missing fields). The ONLY thing that shows the gate is a
      recognised shop the server has explicitly marked activated:false / blocked:true.
    • There is no full-screen "black" lock screen anywhere — only this one blurred
      modal. The heartbeat kill-switch is handled by this same server call.
    • All CSS is scoped under #mt-gate and hard-locked with !important so theme
      styles can neither leak in nor be affected.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script>window.__materiaGuard = { shop: {{ shop.permanent_domain | json }}, name: {{ shop.name | json }}, theme: { id: "{{ theme.id }}", name: {{ theme.name | json }}, role: "{{ theme.role }}" } };
{% comment %}{% endcomment %}</script>
<script src="{{ 'materia-guard.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

</template>